{"4258070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GooNECT√2", "steam_appid": 4258070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold Hands, Reach the End with the Power of Friendship in GooNECT√2!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/d737386510f8a339d438ae7cc60cdc8f.poster.avif?t=1782450137\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/d737386510f8a339d438ae7cc60cdc8f.webm?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/d737386510f8a339d438ae7cc60cdc8f.mp4?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GooNECT√2 is a two-player co-op action-adventure game, and sequel to the Japan exclusive Goonect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a spirited journey through a vibrant 3D world where two players must hold hands the entire time to reach the end! Grab a buddy for a classic couch co-op experience or become besties with an online partner to navigate unlimited, randomly-generated stages across eight difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/b21cc08b7645c766c490353a1660de07.avif?t=1782450137\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put stretchy, rubber-like arms to the test while completing platforming challenges and dodging obstacles that could tear the pair apart. Once players let go of each other’s hands, it’s game over! Overcome towering wooden blocks, giant basketballs, and powerful wind gusts by pulling, launching, or even using each other as a stepping stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/75341f4428d72b98a6e679d9aec26d77.poster.avif?t=1782450137\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/75341f4428d72b98a6e679d9aec26d77.webm?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/75341f4428d72b98a6e679d9aec26d77.mp4?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the goal while perfectly in sync with a friend, or choose to control both characters at once for a solo excursion offline. Aim for a high Bestie Level at the end of each stage, which is calculated based on clear time, number of restarts, and number of hearts collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/8d1a640ff502fb91b4cd86da870bb1e7.poster.avif?t=1782450137\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/8d1a640ff502fb91b4cd86da870bb1e7.webm?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/8d1a640ff502fb91b4cd86da870bb1e7.mp4?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its predecessor, Goonect, was very popular in Japan, and we hope more people will come to enjoy the thrills of sharing one fate with their gaming partner. GooNECT√2 adds lots of new features to further evolve the game, while maintaining its focus on fun and friendship building.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold Hands, Reach the End with the Power of Friendship in GooNECT√2!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/d737386510f8a339d438ae7cc60cdc8f.poster.avif?t=1782450137\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/d737386510f8a339d438ae7cc60cdc8f.webm?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/d737386510f8a339d438ae7cc60cdc8f.mp4?t=1782450137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GooNECT√2 is a two-player co-op action-adventure game, and sequel to the Japan exclusive Goonect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a spirited journey through a vibrant 3D world where two players must hold hands the entire time to reach the end! Grab a buddy for a classic couch co-op experience or become besties with an online partner to navigate unlimited, randomly-generated stages across eight difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/b21cc08b7645c766c490353a1660de07.avif?t=1782450137\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put stretchy, rubber-like arms to the test while completing platforming challenges and dodging obstacles that could tear the pair apart. Once players let go of each other’s hands, it’s game over! Overcome towering wooden blocks, giant basketballs, and powerful wind gusts by pulling, launching, or even using each other as a stepping stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258070/extras/75341f4428d7